WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:08.780
Let's pray together over day 16, an undivided heart in

2
00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:09.820
Psalm 86:11.

3
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.200
Father, thank you for teaching us your way.

4
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.960
We believe that you're not hiding the way of holiness from us.

5
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:22.300
We believe that you're not concealing it behind

6
00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:26.759
mystical experiences or undoable things.

7
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.460
We believe that we can rely on your faithfulness.

8
00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:33.540
You are true in the inward parts. You are true all the way to

9
00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:35.380
