10
00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:37.960
So Lord, teach us your way.

11
00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:41.120
We know that you're not hiding it, so show it to us.

12
00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:43.640
Give us, Lord, an undivided heart.

13
00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:48.000
Give us insight, Lord, to see where our heart is double-minded

14
00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:48.800
