16
00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:56.580
So we pray that you would give us wisdom to see that.

17
00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:57.360
And Lord, we,

18
00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:02.380
like David, are inspired by the Holy Spirit to

19
00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:06.200
pray that you would heal that division in our

20
00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:09.490
heart, that you would not allow us to live out our days

21
00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:14.250
divided and pulled one way and then pulled

22
00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:17.600
another way, pulled God's way and pulled our way.

23
00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:21.160
But instead, Lord, we pray for the Holy Spirit's work

24
00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:25.210
to do that uniting work in our heart

25
00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:29.560
so that our heart would not be broken in the way we

26
00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:31.680
live our lives, but that it would be united.

27
00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:34.380
Please, God, I pray that you would help us to

28
00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:38.320
live in the fear of the Lord because of

29
00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:38.960
this

30
00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:43.020
undivided heart. Lord, so often we've lived

31
00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:47.060
not in the fear of God. We've lived in the fear of man, or we've

32
00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:50.760
lived in selfishness. But instead, Lord, give us a united

33
00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:51.120
heart,

34
00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:55.940
one that is able to really fear your name

35
00:01:56.200 --> 00:02:00.160
and your reputation and to live for the glory of your holiness.

36
00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:04.740
Change our heart so that it leads to a change in behavior, we pray in

37
00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:05.740
